  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><p data-start=\"114\" data-end=\"467\" id=\"isPasted\"><strong data-start=\"114\" data-end=\"149\">• About our brand and products:</strong><br data-start=\"149\" data-end=\"152\">Wanderwell creates unisex slip-on sneakers designed for comfort, style, and adventure. Our shoes feature vibrant colors, versatile designs, and washable materials — made for everything from travel days and errands to evenings out. Whether you’re a city walker or a beach wanderer, Wanderwells are your go-to pair.</p><p data-start=\"469\" data-end=\"801\"><strong data-start=\"469\" data-end=\"499\">• What makes us different:</strong><br data-start=\"499\" data-end=\"502\">Our sneakers combine fashion-forward design with real-life practicality. They’re fully washable, lightweight, and built with all-day comfort in mind — so they look fresh and feel amazing no matter where life takes you. Plus, we’re a small, Miami-based brand with a big heart and a loyal community.</p><p data-start=\"803\" data-end=\"1068\"><strong data-start=\"803\" data-end=\"833\">• How affiliates can earn:</strong><br data-start=\"833\" data-end=\"836\">Earn <strong data-start=\"841\" data-end=\"859\">15% commission</strong> on every sale you drive using your unique affiliate link. We’ll send you a free pair of Wanderwells to create content with, and top performers get early access to new drops + exclusive collab opportunities.</p><p data-start=\"1070\" data-end=\"1096\"><strong data-start=\"1070\" data-end=\"1094\">• How to promote us:</strong></p><ul data-start=\"1097\" data-end=\"1416\"><li data-start=\"1097\" data-end=\"1168\"><p data-start=\"1099\" data-end=\"1168\">Share your Wanderwell shoes on Instagram, TikTok, YouTube, or blogs</p></li><li data-start=\"1169\" data-end=\"1246\"><p data-start=\"1171\" data-end=\"1246\">Create lifestyle content, styling videos, unboxings, or “wash test” demos</p></li><li data-start=\"1247\" data-end=\"1331\"><p data-start=\"1249\" data-end=\"1331\">Show how Wanderwells fit into your everyday — work, travel, weekends, and beyond</p></li><li data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1416\"><p data-start=\"1334\" data-end=\"1416\">Use your affiliate link in captions, bios, and stories to drive clicks and sales</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"1418\" data-end=\"1724\"><strong data-start=\"1418\" data-end=\"1442\">• Other information:</strong><br data-start=\"1442\" data-end=\"1445\">We love building long-term relationships with our affiliates. Our team will send you seasonal content ideas, high-quality brand photos, and early product updates to help your promotions perform. If your audience values style, comfort, and versatility — they’ll love Wanderwell.</p></div></div>",
